    PrivateTmp, CapabilityBoundingSet= (drop all), RestrictAddressFamilies,
    MemoryMax=256M, RuntimeDirectory=secubox, RuntimeDirectoryPreserve=yes
    (prevents /run/secubox socket-wipe cascade, #741).
  * AppArmor enforce profile for /usr/sbin/sbxwaf (rw logs/cache/run,
    r config/secrets, deny everything else).
  * Dedicated secubox-waf system user (CSPN privilege separation).
  * postinst: safe dir creation (never chmod shared parents /etc/secubox,
    /var/log/secubox, /var/cache/secubox to 0750 — traversal constraint
    from #511/#620 board lessons). Enables @1 and @2 on install/upgrade.

